Third-party components
======================

This repository redistributes third-party material that is NOT covered by
the ISC grant above. Each keeps its own terms:

  views/script.js          bootstrap-tagsinput, Copyright (c) 2013 Tim
                           Schlechter, MIT License. See the header of that
                           file; the vendored copy had its attribution
                           stripped and it was reconstructed from upstream.

  public/bebas_neue/       SIL Open Font License 1.1. Ships OFL.txt and
                           OFL-FAQ.txt alongside the font.

  public/VCR_OSD_MONO_1.001.ttf
                           LICENSE UNRESOLVED. The file carries no license
                           in a sibling file and none inside the font's own
                           name table (no nameID 0, 13 or 14). Its terms
                           have deliberately not been guessed. See
                           public/VCR_OSD_MONO.LICENSE-STATUS.txt before
                           redistributing this repository.

The application invokes ffmpeg, ffprobe and GraphicsMagick as external
programs by absolute path. They are not bundled or linked, so their
licenses do not extend to this software as distributed. Bundling any of
them into a packaged build would change that analysis.
